{
  "$schema": "iswc-preview/v1",
  "tag": "iswc-component-diagram",
  "category": "diagrams",
  "title": "&lt;iswc-component-diagram&gt;",
  "titleHtml": false,
  "storageKey": "docs-iswc-component-diagram",
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "intro",
      "title": "Uso",
      "lede": "Diagrama de componentes UML en SVG, sin Mermaid: paquetes, componentes con estereotipo e interfaces provided/required.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": "<p>El empaque dispersa las cajas. Ajusta la distancia mínima con <code>min-gap</code> (px) o con <code>layout.minGap</code> en el JSON. Valores por eje: <code>rowGap</code>, <code>colGutter</code>, <code>pkgCorridor</code>.</p>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": [
            "<iswc-component-diagram min-gap=\"64\" open-on-click>",
            "  <script type=\"application/json\">",
            "    {",
            "      \"componentDiagram\": {",
            "        \"title\": \"Servicio de voz\",",
            "        \"packages\": [",
            "          { \"id\": \"pkg-api\", \"label\": \"API\", \"hue\": 210, \"x\": 36, \"y\": 56, \"w\": 540, \"h\": 220 }",
            "        ],",
            "        \"components\": [",
            "          { \"id\": \"gw\", \"label\": \"Gateway\", \"stereotype\": \"worker\", \"hue\": 210, \"x\": 56, \"y\": 100, \"w\": 140, \"h\": 56 },",
            "          { \"id\": \"sess\", \"label\": \"Sesion\", \"stereotype\": \"module\", \"hue\": 210, \"x\": 300, \"y\": 100, \"w\": 140, \"h\": 56 },",
            "          { \"id\": \"db\", \"label\": \"D1\", \"stereotype\": \"db\", \"hue\": 150, \"x\": 300, \"y\": 188, \"w\": 140, \"h\": 50 }",
            "        ],",
            "        \"links\": [",
            "          { \"from\": \"gw\", \"to\": \"sess\" },",
            "          { \"from\": \"sess\", \"to\": \"db\" }",
            "        ]",
            "      }",
            "    }",
            "  </script>",
            "</iswc-component-diagram>"
          ],
          "controls": [
            {
              "control": "number",
              "prop": "attr:min-gap",
              "label": "min-gap",
              "min": 0,
              "max": 100,
              "step": 1
            },
            {
              "control": "boolean",
              "prop": "attr:open-on-click",
              "label": "open-on-click"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "app-api",
      "title": "App API",
      "lede": "El mismo documento se abre en el visor o en el editor. El parámetro json no se reescribe al modificar el diagrama.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": "<p><a href=\"demos/diagramas/app/view.html?kind=component\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Abrir visor</a> · <a href=\"demos/diagramas/app/edit.html?kind=component\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Abrir editor</a></p>"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "ficha": {
    "sections": {
